WEBVTT

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.310
Did you hear?

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.870
Shirabe-chan and Kirika-chan are strong, right?

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:17.120
I really think they've gotten stronger.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.990
Don't you, Elfnein-chan?

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.600
Yes... I do.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.540
And that will hasten the end of the world!

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:22.990
<b>Episode 9 
The Middle of a Dream</b>

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:27.910
Master...

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.640
Is the last of your spare bodies 
not functioning properly?

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:34.090
I reinstalled my memories, without regard 
for the load it would place on my body.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.130
Also, the memories of killing myself

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.270
are causing a rejection.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.220
What will you do?

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:43.850
I'll ignore it, of course.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.850
All the pieces are in place.

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:50.230
I can't miss this moment!

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.400
I can't see a thing...

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.050
It's totally dark!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:58.780
Just put up your hands. Up!

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.580
Well?

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:03.830
It's just an exam.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.780
You're making this into too big a deal...

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:08.580
It's your fault, you know?

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.170
<b>Incoming Call 

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.690
I have to go to the exam.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.280
Hibiki...

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:20.920
I'm fine.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.550
You are not all right!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.450
I've got you.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:29.960
I've got everyone.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:33.080
So I'm just fine, even without dad.

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:40.180
This is it?

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.070
Kazanari Yatsuhiro's mansion.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.200
This is where you were born.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.450
It's been ten years.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.700
I didn't think I'd be coming back like this.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.710
Displaying observation results.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.990
These areas are receiving 
priority electricity-routing.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.820
There are so many?

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:01.090
And the one that's receiving even 
more than the others is...

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.220
The Undersea Dragon's Palace.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.520
A zone that's absolutely off-limits,

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.160
where unanalyzed items and dangerous 
relic-related materials are sealed away.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:13.230
It's so secret, even we don't know

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.850
details about what's down there.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:19.000
If the Autoscorers were trying to find its location...

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.020
They're after something dangerous there.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:24.990
Then it's easy! We just get there 
before them, and wait for them!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:28.240
But there's one other point 
we believe they'll attack.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:30.870
That's...

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:35.280
Something concerned me, so Intelligence 
did some work on our own.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.210
According to reports, both natural and artificial

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.060
incidents have been destroying shrines.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:44.510
These shrines were all part of the Meiji government's

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.260
supernatural-defense plan for the capital,

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:50.890
which was intended to control the area's ley lines.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:53.080
Alchemy and ley lines...

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.020
We can safely assume this 
is part of the enemy plan.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.650
There is a keystone in the Kazanari mansion.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.670
It's possible they'll also attack it, huh?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.100
We don't have Hibiki because she's 
getting an exam at the hospital,

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.210
but this may be a perfect chance to strike.

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.040
Please stop Carol's rage.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.220
Okay, I'll put together the teams!

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:20.310
Understood.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.840
Chris-san and the others will arrive at 
the Undersea Dragon's Palace shortly.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.740
We should take care we aren't dragged 
into a nest of demons, as well.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.060
The keystone...

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.480
That's...

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.380
Tsubasa-san.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.320
Father.

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:45.990
Good work, Shinji.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:50.880
And I've heard of your activities 
since you joined S.O.N.G.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:51.990
Yes.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.860
Ahnenerbe's department of mysticism has

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:57.780
issued a report on the Alca-Noise.

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.630
I'll have you given access to it later.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.360
Yes, sir.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.450
Father...

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.910
I'm sorry for not contacting you.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.140
The Kazanari household functions 
perfectly without you.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:21.620
When you've finished your duty here, 
return to the battlefield.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:22.720
Wait!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.780
You are her father, right?

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.490
Then there are other things—

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.920
Maria, it's fine.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.820
But...

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.280
It's fine.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:42.850
How barbaric.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.580
I didn't want to interrupt that touching reunion...

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:50.820
You're that Autoscorer!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.890
I shall unleash this ley line.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.810
Then you're after the keystone?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.810
Danse Macabre.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.570
Yeah, I'll play along!

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:15.300
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:54.320
<i>An evil howl's echoes squirm 
madly in the moonlight.</i>

00:07:54.320 --> 00:08:00.530
<i>Tonight I sympathize with my fangs' sharpness.</i>

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:04.330
<i>Give me the letters that will 
make up your death name.</i>

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.020
I'll handle this!

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:08.010
Yes, fulfill your duty.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.550
<i>Oh, it is inevitable.</i>

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.590
<i>In the end, are you no more than a beast?</i>

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.430
Now, try and catch me.

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:18.850
<i>Will you rust and shatter?</i>

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.920
<i>My days are spent uncertain, hesitating.</i>

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:29.310
<i>But now, I bring down a flash of 
lamentation upon wickedness.</i>

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.360
<b>Azure Flash</b>

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.790
<i>Evil will be slain without hesitation.</i>

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:38.630
<i>The wolf's shining fang has two edges, 
bringing death to itself, as well.</i>

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:43.620
<i>Knowing it will grind its death and bleed,</i>

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.620
<b>Imperial Wrath of Heaven</b>

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.620
What is that, I wonder.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.990
<i>it devours anyway.</i>

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:50.880
What?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:57.140
<i>My sword is being broken...</i>

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:03.270
Tsubasa!

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.830
My Sword Break is

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.380
a philosophical weapon

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:12.970
that can destroy anything defined as a sword, 
regardless of hardness or strength.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:15.530
Now, what will you do?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.280
Even the enhanced Symphogears 
aren't strong enough?

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:20.870
It's useless.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.560
Oh,

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:31.090
was the Airgetlám defined as a sword, as well?

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:32.950
Philosophical weapons...

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.340
They affect concepts themselves, 
and are closer to curses or geasa?

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:38.790
Sorry.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:41.440
I am not interested in your songs.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:45.800
Tell the sword girl, would you?

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:49.800
When she wakes, I shall return to hear her songs.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.870
We failed to defend the keystone.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.120
I'm sorry.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:05.180
I didn't expect they'd attack both points at once.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.620
Both points? You can't mean...

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:09.880
Yes. Intruders are in the Undersea Dragon's Palace.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.500
Security has footage of them.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.010
Carol...

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.760
Did she kneel before the devil and beg,
 then come back to life?

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:22.670
I don't want to fall into their trap,

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.580
but we can't ignore this.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:28.440
Chris-kun, take Shirabe-kun 
and Kirika-kun, and go.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.270
Right.

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.740
So this is the Undersea Dragon's Palace?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.030
It's big!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.590
This isn't a picnic... Let's go!

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:42.710
Right!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.710
I have structural data for the building.

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:48.290
Hurry and find the intruder!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.800
Carol's goal is to destroy the world.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:55.600
She must be trying to find one of the relics there,

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.920
or some dangerous item related to them.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.050
I see...

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:17.720
I was fighting Phara...

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:20.610
<i>Even after throwing away those dreams 
that were too good for me,</i>

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.140
<i>I'm still not good enough?</i>

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:26.600
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.280
I'm sorry. She caught me off-guard.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:32.750
If you can move, I'd like you to come with me.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.840
Your father wants to speak to you.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.020
I understand.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:41.220
What's this?

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:44.650
We had Ahnenerbe analyze the red particles

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.210
that appear when an Alca-Noise attacks.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.220
This is the report.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:51.000
Ahnenerbe...

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:53.870
The German government lab that's deeply

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.980
involved with Symphogear research...

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:59.910
The report states that the 
red matter is Prima Materia,

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.360
the fundamental component of matter,

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:04.240
created when matter is decomposed

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.240
by alcahest, the universal solvent.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.370
The fundamental component of matter?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.640
Created by decomposition?

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.750
It says that alchemy is a body of 
theory in heretical technology

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.410
that studies the process of decomposition,

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.290
analysis, and reconstruction.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.950
What does Carol plan to reconstruct after

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.380
she has decomposed the world?

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:25.440
Tsubasa...

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.260
Yes?

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.140
How are your wounds?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.770
I can kill the pain.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.410
Then leave this place, and have this information

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.020
analyzed at the proper facilities.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:42.900
The keystone you were to 
protect is no longer here.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.390
I understand.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:48.310
That may be logical,

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:51.060
but aren't those rather

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.910
cold words for your wounded daughter?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.250
It's fine, Maria...

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.170
Tsubasa!

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.050
It's fine.

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.280
What was that?!

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:04.680
He may be a national security specialist,

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.330
but he doesn't care about his family!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.420
I'm sorry...

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:11.100
But that is how our relationship is.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.650
This was my room when I was little.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.820
We can talk inside.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.070
An enemy attack! Another doll?!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.490
No, um...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.570
This is my fault...

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.980
But I can't believe he hasn't cleaned in ten years.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:31.760
When I was young,

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.980
I remember singing 
old songs for my father here.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:38.460
But this room...

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.240
Has it always been like this?

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.060
Are you saying I'm a girl who can't clean?

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.470
No, I'm talking about your father.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.810
My grandfather...

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:53.100
As he got older, the current head of the family,

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.580
Kazanari Fudou, began to consider

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.710
who would be his heir.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.290
There were two candidates.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.680
His older son, Yatsuhiro, and the 
younger, my uncle Genjuurou.

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:05.360
Commander Kazanari?

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:08.670
But instead of my father or uncle,

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.990
my grandfather chose me,

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:13.210
although I was a newborn.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.120
He chose you?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.440
He never told me why...

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:20.070
But at this point, I can guess.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.880
It seems my father's blood 
doesn't flow in my veins.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:25.950
What?

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:29.090
For the Kazanari blood to remain strong,

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:32.150
my grandfather impregnated my mother.

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:33.000
I was the result.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.390
Kazanari Fudou... Is he inhuman?

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.900
You aren't my daughter.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.150
You're just a filthy tool of the Kazanari family!

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:48.720
Ever since that, I've wanted my father
 to accept me in any way possible.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:53.780
And I have devoted myself to being a tool, 
a sword, instead of a human.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:59.560
But this will only

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:02.540
make him hate me more...

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:06.670
I've linked up with the Palace's control systems.

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:08.940
If I can find out what Carol's after,

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:10.810
we may be able to devise a plan.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:12.550
Stop it there!

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.680
The Yantra Sarvaswa!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.310
What is that?

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:20.690
A collection of information that enables one 
to activate and control any machine.

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.690
If Carol acquires the Trigger Parts,

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.690
she will complete the World Destructor, 
the Château de Tiffauges!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.700
I've located the zone where 
the Yantra Sarvaswa is kept.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.080
Send Chris-kun's team there immediately!

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.070
You destroyed the keystone!

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.000
What are you doing here now?

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:46.750
I only wanted to hear a song.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:54.760
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:29.290
<i>What is true strength?</i>

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.340
<i>I wander in search of the answer.</i>

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:36.100
<i>Is it to be proud? To make a vow? 
I still don't know.</i>

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:42.250
<i>I keep asking the smile in my memories.</i>

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:48.280
<i>I won't forget the heat I still feel in my hand.</i>

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.560
Maria!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:53.990
My body is a blade, and until it shatters...

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.370
If your blade is a sword,

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.630
my philosophy will humiliate it.

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.450
It's being shattered...

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.700
My body, which I trained to be a sword...

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:13.210
And my pride.

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:20.700
That's it?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.490
The Yantra Sarvaswa.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.270
Chris-chan's team has arrived.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:30.840
I've failed at my dreams.

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:34.300
And I fought 
with the pride I still cling to, but...

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.950
How powerless am I?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.860
Tsubasa!

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:40.450
Tsubasa-san!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:42.830
Tsubasa!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.330
Father...

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:47.830
Sing, Tsubasa!

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.940
But I can be neither

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.730
a tool of the Kazanari, nor its sword...

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:54.720
You needn't be either of those things!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.070
Father...

00:17:57.960 --> 00:18:00.350
Do not be afraid of continuing to dream.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.350
My dream?

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.570
That's right.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.850
Your room wasn't just left abandoned 
that way for ten years!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.040
It was messy, but there wasn't a speck of dust!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.540
He kept it that way,

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:18.260
so he wouldn't 
lose the memories he had of you!

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:20.950
No father who hated his daughter would do that!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.700
Just realize it, you stupid girl!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.490
Did my father drive me away

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:30.090
from the 
Kazanari clan to make it easier for me

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.590
to follow my dreams?

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:37.970
If that is my father's wish...

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:40.390
Can I...

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:43.170
...dream again?

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.730
Then listen!

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.660
<i>Ignite Module!</i>

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:55.730
<i>Drawn Blade!</i>

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.350
Dáinsleif.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.260
Let me give you a taste.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.270
<b>Azure Flash</b>

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.040
<b>Emergency Type Sigma Forbidden Moon Wheel</b>

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.420
The Yantra Sarvaswa!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.300
I won't miss that opening!

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:06.560
This is a plain disaster.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.190
Master!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.940
Thousand Falling Tears

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:21.450
No matter how much your output increases...

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.160
As long as you're a sword,

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:30.540
you can never hurt me.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.130
Do not be afraid of continuing to dream.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.680
I am not a sword!

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:45.370
Impossible...

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.350
Why are my philosophical fangs not working?

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.100
Do you call this a sword?

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.100
No!

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:56.540
These are wings, taking flight 
toward their dreams!

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:00.990
Know that your philosophy 
cannot break my wings!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.250
Rasetsu Stance Zero

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.760
What's going on?

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.520
It's been a long time since I had a relic...

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.950
The taste is so sweet,

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.280
so enchanting, so addictive!

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:47.450
No way.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.280
This can't be...

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.330
It sure is.

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.600
I am the man of truth,

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:58.590
Doctor Ver!

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:34.010
<b>Dad 
Cell Phone</b>

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:37.890
<b>Dad 
Cell Phone</b>

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:47.000
What's broken can't go back to how it was...
